  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Greeting & Tuning**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Banter i**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **Maggie Walker Blues (1)**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Banter ii**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Tangled Up in Blue**: rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n- **Cattle in the Cane (1)**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n- **Steampowered Areoplane**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Uncle Pen [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2022-06-15.Schoeps41v** (recommended): source not stated; 25 songs; 139 min [1]\n- **billystrings2022-06-15.Flac**: audience recording; 22 songs; 143 min [2]\n- **BMFS2022-06-15**: source not stated; 22 songs; 137 min [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Notes list Billy Strings on guitar and vocals, with Billy Failing on banjo and vocals [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2022-06-15.Schoeps41v**: taped by Mott77; transferred by Mott77; source: Schoeps MK41v > nBobs > PFAs > Sound Devices Mix Pre II (32F-48) [1]\n- **billystrings2022-06-15.Flac**: taped by Jim Mal; transferred by Jim Mal; source: Audience,Schoeps mk41v's and DPA 4011c's > (2) Sonosax sxm2d2's > Zoom f8n pro 32bit flloat [2]\n- **BMFS2022-06-15**: taped by Jeff Canada; transferred by Jeff Canada; source: Neumann KM184's > f6 (SD) [3]",
